---
description: Android and Jetpack Compose implementation rules
globs:
  - "**/*.kt"
  - "**/*.kts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `docs/ANDROID_IMPLEMENTATION_RULES.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, and `docs/UI_UX_SPEC.md`.

Important:
- prefer Material 3 primitives
- Android-native appearance, not iOS
- respect window/IME insets
- 48dp practical touch targets
- ViewModel owns screen state
- UI renders state and emits actions
- extract reusable composables only when reuse/cohesion justifies it
- avoid direct Supabase/Room/WorkManager logic in composables
- keep module dependency direction clean
- avoid unrelated refactors
